[tool_use] Agent {"description":"Code review Phase 3","subagent_type":"code-reviewer","prompt":"Review Phase 3 changes for code quality, architecture compliance, test sufficiency, maintainability per `/home/aaron/dev/projects/aaron/pointfight-reactor/docs/QUALITY_GATES.md`.\n\nPhase context: Phase 1 = local MVP. Phase 2 = rounds + configurable input + motion indicator + penalty counter. Phase 3 adds visuospatial SVG cues + distance axis + optional audio tone + optional text overlay, with a data-driven cue palette.\n\nFiles in scope (changes since the last `phase-2:` commit `341cecc`):\n- `app/src/engine/types.ts` (Distance type, DISTANCES, CueDistanceEntry, byDistance on CueDef, distance? on RepRecord, distanceAxisEnabled/audioToneEnabled/textOverlayEnabled on DrillConfig)\n- `app/src/engine/drill.ts` (pickDistance, resolveCueAtDistance, classifyRep signature changed cue→isGo, dt rounded to whole ms; pickNextCue uniform-from-library when distance axis enabled)\n- `app/src/engine/drill.test.ts` (new tests for pickDistance, resolveCueAtDistance, pickNextCue distance-on; existing classifyRep tests updated to pass isGo)\n- `app/src/cues/library.ts` (byDistance tables on every cue)\n- `app/src/cues/library.test.ts` (unchanged)\n- `app/src/cues/pictographs.tsx` (NEW — 8 SVG pictograph components + BaseFigure helper)\n- `app/src/cues/palette.ts` (NEW — data-driven CUE_PALETTE record mapping cue id → Pictograph + accent class + animation class)\n- `app/src/cues/palette.test.ts` (NEW — checks palette has entry + byDistance table for every library cue)\n- `app/src/store/session.ts` (distance plumbed through RepInFlight + commitRep; resolveCueAtDistance used for classification)\n- `app/src/store/session.test.ts` (new tests: distance stamping on rep when axis enabled / undefined when disabled)\n- `app/src/store/settings-types.ts` (3 new toggles on SettingsRecord)\n- `app/src/audio/distanceTone.ts` (NEW — Web Audio oscillator with graceful no-op on missing AudioContext)\n- `app/src/ui/CueStage.tsx` (NEW — renders pictograph at distance scale + optional text overlay)\n- `app/src/ui/TrainerScreen.tsx` (uses CueStage; commitKeyLabel prop; audio tone effect)\n- `app/src/ui/SettingsScreen.tsx` (new Visuals section with 3 toggles)\n- `app/src/ui/IdleScreen.tsx` (passes new toggles into start)\n- `app/src/App.tsx` (passes commitKeyLabel into TrainerScreen)\n- `app/src/App.css` (new pictograph + animation rules)\n- `docs/PHASES.md` (unchanged — already lists Phase 3 criteria)\n- `artifacts/decision-memo.md` (rewritten for Phase 3)\n\nAlready locally verified: lint clean, tsc clean, 57/57 tests pass, build succeeds.\n\nCheck specifically:\n- DRY: distance-conditional classification — is the rule encoded in one place?\n- Drift: any Phase 1/2 code path that should have been updated but wasn't (e.g., recent-sessions UI showing the distance axis result, summary screen reflecting distance reps)?\n- Tests: do new tests cover the primary path of every new public behavior plus at least one edge case? Specifically the case where a cue lacks a byDistance table (axis off vs axis on with a hypothetical flat cue).\n- Architecture: is the audio module isolated from the engine? Are pictograph components pure SVG (no DOM side effects)? Is the palette truly data-driven (adding a cue = adding palette entry + library entry, no engine changes)?\n- Correctness: round-on-classify change to reactionMs — does this break any existing serialization or comparison?\n\nReport APPROVE or REQUEST_CHANGES with file:line findings. Under 400 words.","run_in_background":true}
