[text] Phase 3 complete.

**Summary:**
- Added 8 data-driven SVG pictographs (1 per cue) with CSS keyframe animations; palette is a `Record<CueId, PaletteEntry>` so new cues are additive.
- Distance axis: `Distance` type + `pickDistance` + `resolveCueAtDistance`; per-cue `byDistance` rule table on the library; classifyRep refactored to take `isGo` directly; reactionMs now rounded in the engine (single source of truth).
- New CueStage component renders pictograph at far=0.45/mid=0.7/in_range=1.0 scale + optional text overlay.
- Optional Web Audio tone (220/440/660 Hz per distance) with graceful no-op fallback.
- 13 new tests (60 total), lint/tsc/build clean.
